A forced opener of an open kind is literal

```
a{*{*x*}*}b
.
<p>a<strong>{*x</strong>*}b</p>
```

```
*a {*b*} c*
.
<p><strong>a {*b</strong>} c*</p>
```

```
{*a *b* c*}
.
<p><strong>a *b* c</strong></p>
```

```
{/a *b {/c/}*/}
.
<p><em>a *b {/c</em>*/}</p>
```

```
{*a {/b {*c*} d/} e*}
.
<p><strong>a <em>b <strong>c</strong> d</em> e</strong></p>
```

```
{*a {/b *} d/} e*}
.
<p><strong>a <em>b *} d</em> e</strong></p>
```

```
*a {/b *c* d/} e*
.
<p><strong>a <em>b <strong>c</strong> d</em> e</strong></p>
```

```
{==h==}

{//x//}

{= =h= =}

{/ /x/ /}
.
<p><mark>=h=</mark></p>
<p><em>/x/</em></p>
<p><mark> =h= </mark></p>
<p><em> /x/ </em></p>
```
